    "body": "I'm using iTerm2, so I tried changing shell command to `/etc/profiles/per-user/thiro/bin/zsh` and also tried opening another shell by running `/etc/profiles/per-user/thiro/bin/zsh` directly, but this didn't make difference.\r\nThe issue seem to occur all terminal emulator apps I tried (VSCode, iTerm2, macOS's builtin terminal emulator)\r\nUpgrading to 0.56.0 didn't fix the issue either.\r\n\r\nI'm using zsh config generated by home-manager. I'll try turning it off to see if it makes any difference.",
