    "updated_at": "2022-07-21T13:35:02Z",
    "body": "Hm, this is still an issue, using nix zsh/starship installed through home-manager.\r\n\r\n```console\r\nnixos-config on  main [$!⇡] via  on ☁️   took 11s ❯\r\n\r\nnixos-config on  main [$!⇡] via  on ☁️   ❯ echo 1234sdfasdf|base64\r\nMTIzNHNkZmFzZGYK\r\n\r\nnixos-config on  main [$!⇡] via  on ☁️   ❯ echo 1234sdfasdf|base64 --decode\r\n\r\nnixos-config on  main [$!⇡] via  on ☁️   ❯ bash\r\nIvans-MacBook-Air:nixos-config ivan$ echo 1234sdfasdf|base64\r\nMTIzNHNkZmFzZGYK\r\nIvans-MacBook-Air:nixos-config ivan$ echo 1234sdfasdf|base64 --decode\r\nmIvans-MacBook-Air:nixos-config ivan$\r\n```",
