    "updated_at": "2025-05-23T20:16:38Z",
    "body": "I fixed this by adding this to my `.zshrc`:\n```sh\nprecmd() { print '' }\n```\nMake sure you have this in your `starship.toml` to avoid having 2 empty lines between prompts:\n```sh\nadd_newline = false\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
